{"kind": "mod", "id": 1173, "name": "Unda", "slug": "unda", "teaser": "Another bots wave generator", "owner_name": "Barlog_M", "downloads": 23587, "favourites": 10, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "li.barlog.unda", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:03:38.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-11-30T05:57:28.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-10-13T20:28:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.13", "latest_version": "3.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>This is another bot waves generator mod.</p>\n<p>Inspired by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1002-betterspawnsplus/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BetterSpawnsPlus</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1059-moar-bots-spawning-difficulty/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MOAR</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/878-swag-donuts-dynamic-spawn-waves-and-custom-spawn-points/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SWAG + Donuts</a>.</p>\n<p>Any of this mods can do more and do it better.</p>\n<p>This mod is meant to be as simple as possible.</p>\n<p>If you happy with big spawn mods don’t use this one. I made it mostly for myself to keep game as close as possible to vanila SPT-AKI and fix issue when PMC spawns among Scavs and immidently kill each other.</p>\n<p>This mod realize only one algorithm for spawns with minimal settings.</p>\n<p>For PMC</p>\n<p>Amount of PMC is <strong>locationData.base.MinPlayers</strong>. Splits by random size groups from 1 to <strong>config.maxPmcGroupSize</strong>. PMC spawns as a bosses in beginnig of raid (game spawn them in first 60 seconds).\nGame spawns PMC at real PMC spawns points.</p>\n<p>For Scavs</p>\n<p>Maximum amount of regular scavs on a map (locationData.base.BotMax - amount of marksman scavs) split by random size groups from 0 to <code>config.maxScavGroupSize</code> randomly spreaded by spawn zones.</p>\n<p>Scavs spawns in 3 general waves:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>normal difficulty between 60 seconds and +120 seconds.</li>\n<li>normal difficulty between <code>raidLength / 4</code> and +120 seconds.</li>\n<li>hard difficulty between <code>raidLength / 2</code> and +120 seconds.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>PMC and Scavs waves and groups generate after each raid from scratch.</strong></p>\n<p>Since PMC bots count as bots in game, mod increases MaxBots value for most maps by random value between <code>MinPlayers / 2</code> and <code>MinPlayers + 1</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>ChanceForQuietRaid</strong> option changes percent when MaxBots value for map does not increase.</p>\n<p>For small maps like Factory, Laboratory and Reserve by random value between <code>MaxPlayers / 2</code> and <code>MaxPlayers - 1</code>.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1120, "published_at": "2024-04-02T02:05:15.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1173/unda/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 829, "published_at": "2024-07-10T17:33:52.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1173/unda/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 355, "published_at": "2025-03-16T19:55:39.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1173/unda/1.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencie